---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<Base title="IT Partner and MSP Programme | HeyDock" description="White-label dispatch and delivery capacity for UK MSPs and IT partners, under a written agreement that keeps the client relationship with you." canonicalPath="/partners" keywords="MSP partner, white label IT engineers, IT delivery partner UK">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">IT partners</p>
    <h1>Delivery capacity under your brand</h1>
    <p class="lede">For MSPs and IT partners who need extra hands on a site, or a specialist for a short piece of work, without handing the client over.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section white"><div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>What we offer partners</h2>
    <p>White-label engineer dispatch, remote overflow, rollouts, data centre smart hands and related delivery, under a written scope. Client ownership and brand rules are part of the agreement. Reports can be written so you can pass them on.</p>
    <p>A single visit is a valid start. See the <a href="/industries/managed-service-providers">MSP industry page</a> and <a href="/vendor-onboarding">vendor onboarding</a> for how we prefer to set up access and escalation.</p>
    <h2>What we will not do</h2>
    <p>We will not use a partner's client relationship as a lead source. If we cannot attend, we will say so early.</p>
  </div></section>
  <CtaBand title="Talk to us about partner delivery" />
</Base>
